== Trivia ==
* The Bible is a set of Christian scriptures, consisting of 73 books of the Old and New Testaments (66 in Protestant Bibles).
* The Bible item instantly killing {{e|Mom}}, {{e|Mom's Heart}}, and {{E|It Lives!}}, is a reference to the epilogue of ''The Binding of Isaac'' when the Bible hits Mom's head, knocking out or killing her.
* In the original ''Binding of Isaac'', using The Bible on {{E|Isaac}} or {{E|???}} would kill the player.
* {{dlc|a+}} This item is one of the only two ({{dlc|r}} five/ {{dlc|r+}} six) in the game that work toward 2 transformations ({{tf|Bookworm}} and {{tf|Seraphim}}) and is the only activated item to. The other ones are {{i|Magic Mushroom}}, {{i|Hive Mind|r}}, {{i|Parasitoid|r}}, {{I|Skatole|r}}, {{dlc|r+}} and {{i|The Necronomicon}}.
* With an ID of 33, The Bible is the very first active item on the ordered ID list, likely due to its plot relevance.

